00:08:55.859 --> 00:08:56.835
he put the ball in my hands,

00:08:56.835 --> 00:08:58.359
wanted me to play all five positions,

00:08:58.359 --> 00:08:59.969
but he also wanted me to shoot from deep.

00:08:59.969 --> 00:09:01.720
Like I think my dad was ahead of his time.

00:09:01.720 --> 00:09:03.637
He was, well he is 6'9"

00:09:04.558 --> 00:09:07.327
and he was about 210 pounds, 205 pounds?

00:09:07.327 --> 00:09:09.994
I was 6'9" 280 at one point and,

00:09:10.987 --> 00:09:13.399
no, he was really ahead of his time--

00:09:13.399 --> 00:09:14.949
