00:09:14.949 --> 00:09:15.782
- [Kevin] Say it again.

00:09:15.782 --> 00:09:16.949
- Like when you were fat, right?

00:09:16.949 --> 00:09:17.782
Which was like--

00:09:17.782 --> 00:09:18.627
- See, I was just the glutton

00:09:18.627 --> 00:09:20.049
for the sake of being a glutton.

00:09:20.049 --> 00:09:22.269
It wasn't like I had
anything in particular--

00:09:22.269 --> 00:09:23.677
