00:09:29.175 --> 00:09:30.556
- [Kevin] After, so I was, I was--

00:09:30.556 --> 00:09:31.915
- I'm doing my hot take
on this whole issue.

00:09:31.915 --> 00:09:35.838
- Actually was, a little subtle
brag here and not so subtle,

00:09:35.838 --> 00:09:38.885
I was National Athlete of
the Year my senior year

00:09:38.885 --> 00:09:40.554
and if looked at me it would just--

00:09:40.554 --> 00:09:41.466
- [Gary] Stun you.

00:09:41.466 --> 00:09:42.713
- [Kevin] It would stun you.

00:09:42.713 --> 00:09:43.707
You would look and be like this guy?

00:09:43.707 --> 00:09:45.314
- I wish social media was
further along back then

00:09:45.314 --> 00:09:47.636
