00:09:49.648 --> 00:09:50.815
and like just doing dumb
like 15 year-old shit.

00:09:50.815 --> 00:09:53.117
- For sure 'cause I had
no shame in that stuff

00:09:53.117 --> 00:09:54.577
like especially now you talk about---

00:09:54.577 --> 00:09:55.935
- Well by the way I apologize,

00:09:55.935 --> 00:09:57.645
but that's where we're about to go.

00:09:57.645 --> 00:10:00.176
