00:10:07.446 --> 00:10:09.884
really good DNA, and
really good circumstance

00:10:09.884 --> 00:10:12.656
'cause that kid is not insecure.

00:10:12.656 --> 00:10:14.125
- [Kevin] Well not anymore.

00:10:14.125 --> 00:10:16.456
