the manifestation of it.

00:10:16.456 --> 00:10:18.685
So like there's the things,
back to your weight,

00:10:18.685 --> 00:10:20.946
maybe you weren't insecure
about that, people thought,

00:10:20.946 --> 00:10:22.606
clearly there were things
you were insecure about.

00:10:22.606 --> 00:10:25.096
We all are, but this is the manifestation

00:10:25.096 --> 00:10:27.063
of you evolving to closing the gaps

00:10:27.063 --> 00:10:28.617
in certain parts of your insecurity.

00:10:28.617 --> 00:10:30.914
