00:11:40.026 --> 00:11:41.417
coming from the wine world.

00:11:41.417 --> 00:11:43.285
What business would I start

00:11:43.285 --> 00:11:45.985
and I can't stop thinking
about this one thing.

00:11:45.985 --> 00:11:48.486
The number one business as of this moment

00:11:48.486 --> 00:11:50.167
that I would start in the world

00:11:50.167 --> 00:11:52.095
is something in youth athletics,

00:11:52.095 --> 00:11:55.755
because the utter
delusion of every parent.

00:11:55.755 --> 00:11:56.852
- [Kevin] Oh, it's at an all time high.

00:11:56.852 --> 00:12:00.347
