00:56:01.083 --> 00:56:03.553
You know watching Wimbledon the other day.

00:56:03.553 --> 00:56:05.220
Joker, like nothing,

00:56:06.314 --> 00:56:09.625
Joker's by far my favorite
tennis player, by far.

00:56:09.625 --> 00:56:14.602
